  "title": "Yemen's Houthis Target Saudi Arabia with Ballistic Missiles",
  "summary": "Iran-backed Houthi rebels blamed Saudi Arabia for attacks in Yemen's capital, while the U.S. and Iran intensified military actions in the Strait of Hormuz. The Saudi-led coalition launched strikes on Houthi-controlled Hodeidah governorate, while Houthi groups accuse attacks of escalating tensions in Yemen. These actions are part of a broader conflict over regional security and oil supplies.",
